<title>SINGAPORE: Asian rice prices - May 15.</title>
<headline>Asian rice prices - May 15.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rice prices quoted on Thursday by trading and official sources in the key Asian producing nations of Thailand, Vietnam, Pakistan and India in U.S. dollars/tonne:</p>
<p>								May 15    May 8</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct white B benchmark FOB Bangkok 345-370   335-370</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct fragrant rice FOB Bangkok     690-710   690-700</p>
<p>India-5.0 pct broken(non-Basmati long grain)FOB  315	 315</p>
<p>India-10 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  290	 290</p>
<p>India-15 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  270	 270</p>
<p>India-25 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  245	 245</p>
<p>Vietnam-5.0 percent broken FOB Saigon port     230-235   228-235</p>
<p>Vietnam-10 percent broken FOB Saigon port	220-225   221-227</p>
<p>Pakistan-Basmati super FOB Pakistan port	 565-580   565-580</p>
<p>Pakistan-IRRI 6 FOB Pakistan port		  220-225   220-225</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703305)</p>
</text>
